    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d353">

                <pb facs="0436" n="264" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg264"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/4053</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Guatemalan Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Méndez</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 20, 1917</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received April 25.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to
                    inform you that the President of Guatemala has requested me to convey to you his
                    deepest gratitude and to beg that you will be good enough to repeat these
                    expressions to His Excellency President Wilson, for the statements which I had the honor to make to him
                    on the part of the Department of State, that the American Government is disposed
                    to assist the Government of Guatemala in the attitude which it has assumed in
                    the state of war which exists between the United States and the Imperial German
                    Government.</p>
                <p>The President of Guatemala, who is desirious of continuing his support of the
                    principles proclaimed by the United States of America, accepts with the greatest
                    pleasure the assistance offered in a manner as friendly as it is effective, by
                    the illustrious American Government.</p>
                <p>I avail myself [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Joaquín Méndez</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
